--[[
    ========================================================
    TRACKER CONTROLLER v2 - BEGINNER FRIENDLY SCRIPT
    ========================================================
    How to use:
    1. Paste this script into your Roblox executor.
    2. A clean purple/dark menu will pop up on your screen.
    3. Use the Server Players list on the right to click 
       "Target" (focus only on killing that player) or 
       "Ignore" (whitelist them so you don't attack them).
    4. Click the "-" button at the top right to hide/minimize the menu.
--]]

